Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.75,0:00:11.82,Base,,0,0,0,,Every day, we throw away countless things at school.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.72,0:00:16.53,Base,,0,0,0,,But where do they really go?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.03,0:00:27.73,Base,,0,0,0,,Let's take a look at the reality of waste and recycling\Nat Shinjeong Middle School.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.03,0:00:37.14,Base,,0,0,0,,Q.  Do students recycle well at our school?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.64,0:00:47.53,Base,,0,0,0,,A.  Most students do, but some bottles are not rinsed\Nand the labels are not removed. I think we can do better.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.33,0:00:58.74,Base,,0,0,0,,Some students throw away plastic bottles\Nwithout rinsing them or removing their labels.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.54,0:01:09.73,Base,,0,0,0,,Incorrect sorting means that recyclable materials\Nend up in landfills.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.53,0:01:19.12,Base,,0,0,0,,But this problem is not limited to our school.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.02,0:01:25.29,Base,,0,0,0,,Waste is a global problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.09,0:01:34.72,Base,,0,0,0,,What we do at school can make a difference\Nbeyond our community.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.22,0:01:42.19,Base,,0,0,0,,①  Empty completely
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.69,0:01:47.73,Base,,0,0,0,,②  Rinse with water
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.23,0:01:53.55,Base,,0,0,0,,③  Remove the label
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.05,0:02:00.56,Base,,0,0,0,,④  Sort it into the correct recycling bin
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.36,0:02:11.21,Base,,0,0,0,,As global citizens, change begins with our small habits.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.01,0:02:21.11,Base,,0,0,0,,Empty, rinse, remove, and sort!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.61,0:02:31.66,Base,,0,0,0,,Let's protect our Earth together,\Nstarting from our Shinjeong Middle School.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.16,0:02:41.06,Base,,0,0,0,,SMALL ACTIONS.  BIG CHANGES.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.96,0:02:48.46,Base,,0,0,0,,START WITH SHINJEONG MIDDLE SCHOOL
